### Step 1: Schema migration — `migrations/0009_reconciliation.sql`

```sql
ALTER TABLE components ADD COLUMN dissolved_at TEXT;
ALTER TABLE components ADD COLUMN prior_paths TEXT;

UPDATE components SET prior_paths = (
    SELECT json_group_array(f.path)
    FROM component_membership cm
    JOIN files f ON f.id = cm.file_id
    WHERE cm.component_id = components.id
);
```

Register in `src/db/migrations.rs` as `ephemeral_only: false`. This is critical — ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN is not idempotent; it must run once. All existing migrations are `ephemeral_only: true` (re-run on reindex) because they use `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` on ephemeral tables. This migration alters a durable table.

